[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631602425","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102372#issuecomment-2631602425","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102372","id":2631602425,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c2xD5","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T17:16:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T23:17:14Z","body":"Theme item properties should be linked properties to `theme` property. So that the preview of theme item properties is updated promptly in the inspector. Thoughts?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631602425/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634514520","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102372#issuecomment-2634514520","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102372","id":2634514520,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dB4BY","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T16:43:04Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T16:43:04Z","body":"Empty icons show as broken.\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/201bed73-c2c2-4175-8a9e-5e4263416f6e)\r\n\r\nPressing the checkbox for non-objects will revert them to type's default:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/030838d5-ae41-4eb4-98cb-429c4c7b9b9a\r\n\r\nThere is no way to copy the unchecked value. If you try to paste it, the checkbox will disable itself.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/165f905f-476f-4ac7-ae9e-7057a94f3e72\r\n\r\nAnd in case of objects (icon, StyleBox), the checkbox just does nothing and you are supposed to override the value directly. That's not very intuitive.\r\n\r\nI get this is only for displaying, but maybe there is a way to at least fix the broken icons?\r\nThe non-functional checkbox is a pre-existing issue, but seeing a StyleBox makes it more confusing. It would be nice to display some instructions on how to edit these values 🤔 Then again, I didn't see people complaining about it before, so maybe it won't change.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634514520/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635780594","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102372#issuecomment-2635780594","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102372","id":2635780594,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dGtHy","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T06:06:32Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T06:24:48Z","body":"The value field displays the value of the currently **used** theme item, regardless of whether it is checked or not.\r\n\r\n- When _unchecked_, it simply displays the value **used** by the current theme item. No override is set at this time. This usually means that the property value is **Not Set** or **inhert** (in the control).\r\n- When _checked_, the setting override is displayed, which is also the currently **used** theme item.\r\n\r\n> Empty icons show as broken.\r\n\r\nFixed. \r\n![001](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ab739ac-1d3b-4776-af53-348640305f14)\r\n\r\n> Pressing the checkbox for non-objects will revert them to type's default:\r\n\r\nNow it doesn't. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37bf8e46-519f-42bc-bdb5-86363778555f\r\n\r\nAlso allows checking of checkboxes for resources. Since it does not make sense to edit the default resource at the control level (you can try editing it in the source theme resource file, etc.), a **copy** of the default resource will be created when this checkbox is checked. This is a simplification of **Make Unique**.\r\n\r\n> There is no way to copy the unchecked value. If you try to paste it, the checkbox will disable itself.\r\n\r\nIt is more appropriate to think of the _unchecked_ state of a checkbox as **Not Set** or **inhert**. The value pasted is a `Variant()`, which removes the theme item from `theme_*_override`. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d01c51d0-bb3b-44b5-aba1-a8980db829b4\r\n\r\nNow, you can copy values ​​after checking the checkbox.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635780594/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2715803723","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102372#issuecomment-2715803723","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102372","id":2715803723,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6h3-BL","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","ht